The binary compiled from the source code of this package contains the following Rust crates:

One of them is not a dependency but a vendored source copy: `viuer` 0.11.0 is
bundled under `src/rust/src/viuer/`, with its MIT licence in
`src/rust/src/viuer/LICENSE-MIT`. It was modified for this package; the list of
changes is at the top of `src/rust/src/viuer/mod.rs`.


